WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:30.958
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:34.500
there was mention of those four types of people

3
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.791
who don't surrender to Krishna.

4
00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:40.875
Now in this verse, opposite to this,

5
00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:43.041
there's mention of those four people

6
00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:44.125
who walk on the path

7
00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:46.708
of surrender to Krishna.

8
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:52.583
Many times

9
00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:54.083
the beginning of Krishna devotion and surrender

10
00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:57.458
doesn't happen from spiritual love.

11
00:00:57.458 --> 00:00:58.625
But still,

12
00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.208
for various reasons, people

13
00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:02.458
are attracted toward Krishna

14
00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:05.208
and ultimately surrender to Him.

15
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:06.083
The description here is of

16
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:08.958
four such categories of people.

17
00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:10.208
The first category is

18
00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:12.583
ārta, meaning the distressed.

19
00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:13.291
These are those people

20
00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:16.000
who come to Lord Krishna

21
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.875
for solution of their sorrows and pain.

22
00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:20.000
These people, suffering from life's difficulties -

23
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.291
like illness,

24
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:22.375
accident,

25
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:25.500
or some personal loss, etc. -

26
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.916
pray to Krishna for help

27
00:01:27.916 --> 00:01:30.500
to get relief from this pain.

28
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.125
Although their purpose

29
00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:34.041
may be material and personal,

30
00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:35.958
turning toward Krishna itself

31
00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:37.500
is an important step

32
00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.125
of their spiritual journey.

33
00:01:40.125 --> 00:01:43.625
The second category is jijñāsu, those people

34
00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:47.875
who are desirous of understanding
 life's mystery and spiritual truth.

35
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:50.666
Due to this very deep curiosity,

36
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:51.833
these people come in contact

37
00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:54.333
with Lord Krishna's glory

38
00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:55.291
and His spiritual teachings.

39
00:01:55.291 --> 00:01:56.833
Their journey, beginning with intellectual

40
00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:57.708
and emotional

41
00:01:57.708 --> 00:01:59.458
curiosity,

42
00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:02.458
takes them toward spirituality.

43
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:05.458
The third category is arthārthī,

44
00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:08.250
those who come to Krishna's shelter

45
00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.125
with desire for material gain

46
00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:12.250
like wealth, property, and position.

47
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.416
These people, leaving other gods

48
00:02:15.416 --> 00:02:17.500
and goddesses, seek blessings

49
00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.791
from Krishna for their economic prosperity.

50
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:22.250
Even if for economic reasons only,

51
00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.416
this step of theirs

52
00:02:23.416 --> 00:02:24.791
shows their growing faith

53
00:02:24.791 --> 00:02:28.000
in Krishna, and this faith will ultimately

54
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.000
help in their spiritual upliftment.

55
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.708
The final category is of those
 people who are jñānī,

56
00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:37.250
and are desirous of understanding Krishna

57
00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:39.750
and becoming liberated.

58
00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:43.833
These people take shelter of Krishna not
 for economic gain or removal of sorrows,

59
00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:45.458
but for liberation,

60
00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:47.333
for understanding Krishna,

61
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.541
and to go meet Him.

62
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:51.916
They surrender to Krishna.

63
00:02:51.916 --> 00:02:55.041
Whatever the reason may be, even if these people

64
00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:57.375
haven't yet reached complete surrender,

65
00:02:57.375 --> 00:02:58.500
they have

66
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.750
started their journey.

67
00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.416
And this is the beauty of this verse

68
00:03:02.416 --> 00:03:04.708
and of Lord Krishna...

69
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:06.208
that He believes

70
00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:08.500
if the right step has been taken,

71
00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.250
then the complete journey
 will also be completed.

72
00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.916
He Himself stands for guidance...

73
00:03:13.916 --> 00:03:17.125
This Gita is also such a map

74
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:20.958
that will take one who
 takes the right step to Krishna.

75
00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:29.583
You're listening to this Gita at this time,

76
00:03:29.583 --> 00:03:32.458
you're listening to Me.

77
00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:36.125
Perhaps this may be because

78
00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:39.291
you're troubled by some problem,

79
00:03:39.291 --> 00:03:41.958
searching for a solution.

80
00:03:41.958 --> 00:03:44.791
Or it may also be that

81
00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:47.416
everything is fine in life -

82
00:03:47.416 --> 00:03:50.166
no problem, no crisis.

83
00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:53.291
You're prosperous, healthy,

84
00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:56.625
and generally satisfied.

85
00:03:56.625 --> 00:03:58.791
But still,

86
00:03:58.791 --> 00:04:02.166
either you yourself picked up this Gita,

87
00:04:02.166 --> 00:04:03.291
or

88
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:08.000
someone urged you to read it.

89
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.916
Whatever the reason may be,

90
00:04:10.916 --> 00:04:15.833
your curiosity definitely shows from this.

91
00:04:15.833 --> 00:04:18.958
Maintain this curiosity.

92
00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:22.375
Increase this curiosity.

93
00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:24.125
Because this can become

94
00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:29.375
the cause of your life transformation.

95
00:04:29.375 --> 00:04:32.333
This desire to understand life's deep questions.

96
00:04:32.333 --> 00:04:36.458
Where you start thinking

97
00:04:36.458 --> 00:04:39.875
how this world was made,

98
00:04:39.875 --> 00:04:43.291
what's the purpose of your being here,

99
00:04:43.291 --> 00:04:47.541
and what's beyond this material world.

100
00:04:47.541 --> 00:04:51.250
These questions aren't just games of intellect;

101
00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:55.875
these are signs of your inner soul's awakening,

102
00:04:55.875 --> 00:05:00.291
which will inspire you to connect
 with supreme truth.

103
00:05:00.291 --> 00:05:04.125
That curious one mentioned in this verse

104
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:08.041
is definitely hidden somewhere in you,

105
00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:10.916
that curious soul desires to obtain

106
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:15.125
knowledge of soul and supreme truth.

107
00:05:15.125 --> 00:05:17.333
No calamity, no crisis,

108
00:05:17.333 --> 00:05:21.000
or economic purpose is necessary.

109
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:25.250
Only the desire to understand life's mysteries

110
00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.875
can become the foundation

111
00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:30.166
of your spiritual journey.

112
00:05:30.166 --> 00:05:34.083
As you keep asking questions,

113
00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:37.750
I will keep guiding you,

114
00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:41.833
will keep revealing before you that truth

115
00:05:41.833 --> 00:05:44.666
which is beyond the material world.

116
00:05:44.666 --> 00:05:46.500
You'll see

117
00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.916
that the joy and satisfaction of this journey

118
00:05:49.916 --> 00:05:54.000
is far higher,

119
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.791
far sweeter than any material success.

120
00:05:56.791 --> 00:06:00.250
You maintain this curiosity,

121
00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:05.125
I will keep clearing your path.

122
00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:12.833
The perception about Me

123
00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:16.708
that you convey to the family's new generation

124
00:06:16.708 --> 00:06:22.125
becomes the foundation of
 their spiritual awareness.

125
00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:24.333
If you present Me only

126
00:06:24.333 --> 00:06:28.666
as one who solves problems,

127
00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:36.291
or as one who fulfills your goals,

128
00:06:36.291 --> 00:06:41.208
then the new generation
 will also develop this behavior.

129
00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:43.125
Like,

130
00:06:43.125 --> 00:06:44.333
'Krishna,

131
00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:48.250
there's much sorrow, remove our problems.'

132
00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:51.333
'O Krishna, I must obtain this,

133
00:06:51.333 --> 00:06:56.375
I need your blessing.'

134
00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:59.583
I will also destroy your problems,

135
00:06:59.583 --> 00:07:03.416
will also give you blessings.

136
00:07:03.416 --> 00:07:05.416
But

137
00:07:05.416 --> 00:07:07.791
is this relationship

138
00:07:07.791 --> 00:07:12.750
limited only to this give and take?

139
00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:16.000
When I'm seen only for solution of problems

140
00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:21.666
or fulfillment of material desires,

141
00:07:21.666 --> 00:07:26.250
then this relationship can't remain permanent.

142
00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.750
The problem gets solved,
 the goal gets completed,

143
00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:35.583
and then this relationship becomes weak.

144
00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:38.875
Instead of being lifelong,

145
00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:43.250
devotion remains only momentary.

146
00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.833
Spiritual upliftment,

147
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:47.916
which is life's real purpose,

148
00:07:47.916 --> 00:07:50.500
gets lost somewhere.

149
00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.375
But think,

150
00:07:52.375 --> 00:07:54.958
what if you awaken

151
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:58.000
curiosity about Me in the new generation?

152
00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.333
Inspire them

153
00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:02.708
to ask deep questions.

154
00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:04.583
Like,

155
00:08:04.583 --> 00:08:07.083
'Who actually is God?'

156
00:08:07.083 --> 00:08:11.833
or 'Why is this world? Who created it

157
00:08:11.833 --> 00:08:15.208
and what's the purpose of their life?'

158
00:08:15.208 --> 00:08:16.708
This curiosity will inspire them

159
00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:20.500
to obtain My deep understanding.

160
00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.041
Will inspire them to establish

161
00:08:24.041 --> 00:08:27.083
a permanent and priceless relationship with Me.

162
00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:31.125
When they'll know Me not only as a giver,

163
00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:35.333
but will know My complete form,

164
00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:39.041
will consider Me as the source of knowledge,

165
00:08:39.041 --> 00:08:44.125
will see Me as the creator of this universe,

166
00:08:44.125 --> 00:08:45.750
then their spiritual

167
00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:50.000
journey will become enriched and permanent.

168
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.458
Discuss these things in the family -

169
00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:55.708
the mystery of human life,

170
00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:57.833
the purpose of its existence,

171
00:08:57.833 --> 00:09:00.000
its spiritual form.

172
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.416
When such curiosity is awakened,

173
00:09:03.416 --> 00:09:08.125
then knowing Me, or reading this Gita,

174
00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:11.166
won't be a duty or tradition,

175
00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:15.000
but will become a joyful experience.

176
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.666
New peace

177
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:21.166
and new self-confidence will
 flow in the new generation.

178
00:09:21.166 --> 00:09:23.750
They'll know

179
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.083
that I am always

180
00:09:26.083 --> 00:09:28.250
with them.

181
00:09:32.625 --> 00:09:34.958
At the workplace,

182
00:09:34.958 --> 00:09:39.791
people work with different motivations -

183
00:09:39.791 --> 00:09:43.875
some due to necessity or compulsion,

184
00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:46.791
some for wealth and honor,

185
00:09:46.791 --> 00:09:51.083
some for curiosity of continuously
 learning new things,

186
00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:55.916
and some with a deep life purpose.

187
00:09:55.916 --> 00:10:00.958
If seen, these people are also like

188
00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:06.125
what I explained in this verse -

189
00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:08.833
ārta, means distressed

190
00:10:08.833 --> 00:10:12.208
arthārthī means desirous of wealth

191
00:10:12.208 --> 00:10:15.833
jijñāsu means inspired by curiosity

192
00:10:15.833 --> 00:10:20.291
and jñānī knowledgeable-

193
00:10:20.291 --> 00:10:22.541
such motivations

194
00:10:22.541 --> 00:10:26.000
are also visible at the workplace.

195
00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.625
First are

196
00:10:27.625 --> 00:10:32.000
those who work only due to necessity of livelihood

197
00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:36.916
or due to economic compulsions.

198
00:10:36.916 --> 00:10:38.291
These people want to

199
00:10:38.291 --> 00:10:41.458
fulfill their basic needs.

200
00:10:41.458 --> 00:10:44.458
Just as distressed people take shelter in Me

201
00:10:44.458 --> 00:10:48.750
only for solution of sorrows,

202
00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.250
these people also want in their work

203
00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:55.583
only solution of livelihood.

204
00:10:55.583 --> 00:10:58.750
They have dedication in their work,

205
00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:03.500
but cannot obtain permanent satisfaction.

206
00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:07.000
Second are arthārthī -

207
00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:11.791
who work for wealth, honor, and success.

208
00:11:11.791 --> 00:11:16.291
Their purpose is external and material success.

209
00:11:16.291 --> 00:11:18.750
They work hard,

210
00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:22.833
but once the desire is fulfilled,

211
00:11:22.833 --> 00:11:26.625
they engage in search of new purpose.

212
00:11:26.625 --> 00:11:30.500
Permanent satisfaction isn't here either.

213
00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.250
Third are people inspired by curiosity -

214
00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:38.333
who work in search of new 
knowledge and experience.

215
00:11:38.333 --> 00:11:42.250
They bring new ideas and new energy,

216
00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:46.041
but when something starts seeming old,

217
00:11:46.041 --> 00:11:49.208
when there's nothing new to learn,

218
00:11:49.208 --> 00:11:53.291
they become indifferent.

219
00:11:53.291 --> 00:11:55.375
Finally are

220
00:11:55.375 --> 00:11:56.750
jñānī -

221
00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:01.708
who see their work with a higher purpose.

222
00:12:01.708 --> 00:12:06.000
These people are permanent and dedicated,

223
00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.875
because their purpose isn't external success,

224
00:12:09.875 --> 00:12:10.791
but

225
00:12:10.791 --> 00:12:15.000
is connected to a deep spiritual relationship.

226
00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.583
Whether good time or bad,

227
00:12:17.583 --> 00:12:21.041
they know this is momentary,

228
00:12:21.041 --> 00:12:25.041
and their dedication doesn't waver.

229
00:12:25.041 --> 00:12:27.125
Think,

230
00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:29.416
whether you're working

231
00:12:29.416 --> 00:12:35.416
due to necessity or compulsion,
 working for material success,

232
00:12:35.416 --> 00:12:38.833
or to learn something new...

233
00:12:38.833 --> 00:12:41.625
You're working,

234
00:12:41.625 --> 00:12:46.458
but still permanent satisfaction isn't obtained.

235
00:12:46.458 --> 00:12:50.791
Now just bring one change in perspective.

236
00:12:50.791 --> 00:12:53.666
Think how your work

237
00:12:53.666 --> 00:12:56.875
improves others' lives.

238
00:12:56.875 --> 00:13:00.458
How you're connected to human welfare.

239
00:13:00.458 --> 00:13:06.500
How you're an important part
of a bigger purpose?

240
00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:07.875
This perspective

241
00:13:07.875 --> 00:13:12.208
will give you satisfaction, a new peace.

242
00:13:12.208 --> 00:13:17.708
Will give a deeper purpose for working.

243
00:13:17.708 --> 00:13:19.291
Become jñānī.

244
00:13:19.291 --> 00:13:23.750
Find purpose and satisfaction in work.
